    <mxCell id="p2_t1" value="&lt;b&gt;Task 2.1: Domain Types &amp;amp; Integer Cents Standard&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;• Define &lt;code&gt;Account&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Transaction&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Category&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Rule&lt;/code&gt; interfaces&lt;br&gt;• Build Cents &amp;lt;-&amp;gt; Decimal math utilities &amp;amp; currency formatters&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;💡 Learning: Financial Precision &amp;amp; Preventing IEEE 754 Floating-Point Bugs&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#86efac;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="phase2">
      <mxGeometry x="20" y="45" width="500" height="60" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="p2_t2" value="&lt;b&gt;Task 2.2: Dexie.js (IndexedDB) Database &amp;amp; Seed Data&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;• Initialize Dexie schema with indexed compound keys&lt;br&gt;• Build mock data generator with 200+ realistic transactions for instant testing&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;💡 Learning: Browser Storage Capabilities (IndexedDB vs LocalStorage)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#86efac;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="phase2">
      <mxGeometry x="20" y="115" width="500" height="60" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="p2_t3" value="&lt;b&gt;Task 2.3: TanStack Query v5 Integration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;• Create custom hooks: &lt;code&gt;useTransactions()&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;useAccounts()&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;useCategories()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Implement query keys factory &amp;amp; mutation cache invalidation&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;💡 Learning: Server State Synchronization &amp;amp; Asynchronous Cache Invalidation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#86efac;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="phase2">
