    <mxCell id="p3_t2" value="&lt;b&gt;Task 3.2: Top Header, Date Picker &amp;amp; Theme Switcher&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;• Quick Stats balance counter with currency symbol switcher&lt;br&gt;• Global date range filter dropdown (This Month, Last 90 Days, Custom)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7c3aed&quot;&gt;💡 Learning: Global Filter Context &amp;amp; Accessible Date Range Selectors&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d8b4fe;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="phase3">
