    <mxCell id="p3_t3" value="&lt;b&gt;Task 3.3: Financial KPI Metric Cards with Skeleton Loaders&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;• Net Worth, Monthly Inflow, Monthly Outflow &amp;amp; Savings Rate %&lt;br&gt;• Polished animated Skeleton states (zero layout shift / CLS = 0)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7c3aed&quot;&gt;💡 Learning: Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) Optimization &amp;amp; Skeleton UX&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d8b4fe;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="phase3">
