    <mxCell id="p4_t1" value="&lt;b&gt;Task 4.1: TanStack Table v8 Core Setup&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;• Column definitions with sorting, resizing &amp;amp; column visibility toggle&lt;br&gt;• Custom renderers: formatted currency badge, category color pills&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ea580c&quot;&gt;💡 Learning: Headless Data Tables &amp;amp; Decoupling Logic from Markup&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#fed7aa;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="phase4">
      <mxGeometry x="20" y="45" width="500" height="55" as="geometry"/>
