    <mxCell id="p4_t2" value="&lt;b&gt;Task 4.2: 60fps Virtual Scrolling (TanStack Virtual)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;• Virtualize table body to handle 5,000+ transactions effortlessly&lt;br&gt;• Preserve natural browser scrollbar height &amp;amp; keyboard focus&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ea580c&quot;&gt;💡 Learning: DOM Node Virtualization &amp;amp; High-Frequency Event Throttling&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#fed7aa;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="phase4">
