    <mxCell id="p5_t1" value="&lt;b&gt;Task 5.1: Cashflow Inflow vs Outflow (Recharts)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;• Monthly income vs expense grouped bar chart with custom tooltips&lt;br&gt;• Dynamic timeframe selector (6 months, 12 months, all-time)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ca8a04&quot;&gt;💡 Learning: SVG Data Visualization, Responsive Containers &amp;amp; Theming&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#fde047;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="phase5">
      <mxGeometry x="20" y="45" width="500" height="60" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="p5_t2" value="&lt;b&gt;Task 5.2: Spending Category Donut &amp;amp; Budget Gauges&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;• Category expense distribution interactive pie/donut chart&lt;br&gt;• Monthly budget progress bars with alert triggers when &amp;gt; 100%&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ca8a04&quot;&gt;💡 Learning: Complex Data Aggregation, Memoization (&lt;code&gt;useMemo&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#fde047;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="phase5">
