    <mxCell id="p6_t1" value="&lt;b&gt;Task 6.1: Drag-and-Drop CSV Statement Importer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;• Multi-Bank CSV column mapper with preview modal (PapaParse)&lt;br&gt;• Duplicate detection using SHA-256 fingerprint (&lt;code&gt;date+cents+payee&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#059669&quot;&gt;💡 Learning: File Drag-and-Drop API, Web Workers &amp;amp; Client-side Hashing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6ee7b7;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="phase6">
      <mxGeometry x="20" y="45" width="500" height="60" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="p6_t2" value="&lt;b&gt;Task 6.2: Client-side Automation Rules Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;• Condition-action rules evaluator (e.g. &lt;i&gt;if Payee matches &quot;Uber&quot; -&amp;gt; &quot;Transport&quot;&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;br&gt;• 1-Click Historic re-run engine to re-classify past messy transactions&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#059669&quot;&gt;💡 Learning: Rule Engine Pattern &amp;amp; High-Throughput Batch Processing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6ee7b7;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="phase6">
      <mxGeometry x="20" y="115" width="500" height="60" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="p6_t3" value="&lt;b&gt;Task 6.3: JSON Backup/Restore, Cmd+K Menu &amp;amp; a11y Audit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;• 1-Click Full Database JSON Export/Import for data ownership&lt;br&gt;• Global Command Palette (Cmd+K) &amp;amp; Full keyboard navigation check&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#059669&quot;&gt;💡 Learning: Data Portability Standards &amp;amp; Lighthouse 100/100 Accessibility&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6ee7b7;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="phase6">
